A project attached with no specs directory under its vault is a user error naming the tier and
the root it looked at; nothing reaches stdout.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
-- cmd --
booping specs ls
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: no specs for tier `project` at {CWD}/vault/specs
